~ epilogue
Child: You finally came back
…I didn’t mean to leave
Child: I’m.. tired of waiting for you
Child: Yeah, i knew [wait=0.2 ], i knew [wait=0.8]it thats why i always believe in you, [shake amp=5.0 freq=3.0]in myself [/shake]
[speed=0.8]…I got used to the quiet.[/speed]
It felt safer that way
Child: I know
Child: But you don’t have to stay here anymore
Child: Come with me

